        "summary": "Octanuclear Dy8 cluster with two fused cubane [Dy4(μ3-OH)4] units shows SMM-like slow magnetic relaxation. χmT decreases on cooling then rises to 94.9 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K, indicating dominant low-T intracluster ferromagnetic coupling. Magnetization at 2 K reaches 42.92 NμB at 7 T without saturation. Frequency-dependent ac signals appear under zero dc field, but χ″ has no maximum up to 1488 Hz; estimated U ≈ 4.3 K and τ0 ≈ 1.3×10−6 s.",
