      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Hendecanuclear Dy11 cluster with four fused cubane units exhibits slow magnetization relaxation. χmT decreases to 128.6 cm3 K mol−1 at 17 K, a shoulder of 128.9 cm3 K mol−1 at 8.0 K, then 122.3 cm3 K mol−1 at 2.0 K, consistent with Stark depopulation plus weak intra-cluster Dy···Dy coupling. Magnetization at 2 K reaches 57.84 NμB at 7 T without saturation. Zero-field ac data show frequency-dependent χ′/χ″ but no χ″ maximum up to 1488 Hz; estimated U ≈ 1.8 K and τ0 ≈ 7.5×10−6 s.",
